      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "puede",
      "answerEn": "may; can (he, she, it, or formal you)",
      "noteEn": "Puede is a present form of poder. Before another action verb, it can express either ability or a possibility; the surrounding sentence supplies the subject.",
